Scope
-----

This license covers the material in this repository, which comprises:

  * `packages/desktop-app/` and `packages/unity-plugin/` -- the application and
    the Unity Editor package.
  * `scripts/`, `tools/` and the root build configuration.
  * `Documentation/BUSY Bar API & Display Technical Developer Guide.md`,
    `Documentation/busy_bar_controller_studio.html`,
    `Documentation/hardware-samples/` and `Documentation/design-history/`.
  * `icon reference/` -- the original 16x16 source artwork. The third-party
    logos that folder's README describes are untracked and are not part of
    this repository.

It does not cover, and this project makes no claim over:

  * The BUSY Bar hardware, its firmware, and BUSY Bar's own documentation,
    OpenAPI specification and example applications. Those belong to their
    authors -- see https://github.com/busy-app. Local copies of that material,
    if present, live in `Documentation/private/`, which is untracked and never
    redistributed from here.
  * `scripts/busybar-anim-toolchain/` -- the firmware's `.anim` compiler,
    (c) 2024-2026 Flipper FZCO under GPL-2.0-or-later. Its licence text and
    provenance are in that folder. It runs as a separate program at build
    time and is not part of the installer.
  * Third-party trademarks and brand marks. Application names and logos appear
    only to identify the applications whose notifications this software
    displays; ownership remains with their respective holders.
  * Dependencies, which carry their own licenses.


Assets drawn for this project
-----------------------------

The LED animations in `Animations/` are drawn for this project, from the scenes
in `packages/anim-studio/scenes/`, and are covered by the MIT terms above.

They replaced three frame sets from the BUSY Bar firmware (`lunch_72x16`,
`back_soon_72x16` and `meeting_72x16`, Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Flipper FZCO,
CC-BY-SA-4.0, https://github.com/busy-app/busybar-firmware). Those are no longer
part of the application; earlier revisions of this repository still contain
them, under that licence.

The pixel fonts -- the glyph sheets in `packages/desktop-app/fonts/` and the
tables generated from them in `packages/desktop-app/src/shared/fonts/` -- are
drawn for this project and covered by the MIT terms above. They replaced a
table converted from the BUSY Bar firmware's own font, which is OFL-1.1
(Copyright (c) 2021 TakWolf; Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Flipper FZCO). That table
is no longer part of the application; earlier revisions of this repository
still contain it, under that licence.
